# Wateen Maintainers

This file lists the designated maintainers authorized to modify automation tags
and approve high-risk operations as defined in `.agent/workflows/ai_swarm.md`.

## Format

Each maintainer entry follows this format:
```
## Name (GitHub Username)
- Role: [role]
- Scope: [areas of responsibility]
```

## Primary Maintainers

## Azmy Ayman (azmyayman-maker)
- Role: Lead Maintainer
- Scope: Full project access, automation control, security reviews

## Maintainer Permissions

| Permission | Maintainers |
|------------|-------------|
| Modify `turbo-all` tag | All listed maintainers |
| Approve high-risk operations | Lead Maintainer |
| Security review sign-off | All listed maintainers |
| Audit log access | All listed maintainers |

## Authorization Requirements

1. Changes to `.agent/MAINTAINERS` require approval from the Lead Maintainer
2. New maintainer additions must be documented with scope and role
3. Maintainer removals should be logged in `.agent/logs/audit.log`